{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-2146","published":"2026-05-03T11:11:08Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:50.260703318Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-1940"],"summary":"gstreamer1-plugins-good security update","details":"Security Fix(es):\n\nAn incomplete fix for CVE-2024-47778 allows an out-of-bounds read in gst_wavparse_adtl_chunk() function. The patch added a size validation check lsize + 8 &gt; size, but it does not account for the GST_ROUND_UP_2(lsize) used in the actual offset calculation. When lsize is an odd number, the parser advances more bytes than validated, causing OOB read.(CVE-2026-1940)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-good","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/gstreamer1-plugins-good&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["gstreamer1-plugins-good-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","gstreamer1-plugins-good-debuginfo-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","gstreamer1-plugins-good-debugsource-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","gstreamer1-plugins-good-gtk-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["gstreamer1-plugins-good-help-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.noarch.rpm"],"src":["gstreamer1-plugins-good-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["gstreamer1-plugins-good-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","gstreamer1-plugins-good-debuginfo-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","gstreamer1-plugins-good-debugsource-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","gstreamer1-plugins-good-gtk-1.16.2-12.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2146.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-good","ecosystem":"openEuler:22.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/gstreamer1-plugins-good&distro=openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.16.2-12.oe2203sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["gstreamer1-plugins-good-1.16.2-12